There's no need to look at your save file.  You have just discovered one of
Hell's distinguishing characteristics.  There are no down staircases.
(Except for in Vlad's Tower, but that's a special case)
The trick, therefore, is to somehow get to the bottom of hell and work your
way back up.

Spoiler...

To do this, you need teleport control and either a level-teleport trap or
a cursed scroll of teleport.  Reading a scroll of teleport while confused will
also work.  (provided you have teleport control, of course)

The deepest you can go into Hell is level 50.

